47567:{"w":"least","e":"She did the least of all of us, but she still got the same prize.","t":"我们中她做得**最少**，却得了同样的奖。"},
47568:{"w":"engineer","e":"My aunt is an engineer who designs bridges for the city.","t":"我姨妈是一名为城市设计桥梁的**工程师**。"},
47569:{"w":"join","e":"I want to join the school music club because I love singing.","t":"我想**加入**学校音乐社团，因为我热爱唱歌。"},
47570:{"w":"marry","e":"My cousin is going to marry her boyfriend next spring in their hometown.","t":"我表姐明年春天要在老家**嫁给**她男朋友。"},
47571:{"w":"possess","e":"She possesses a great talent for music and can play four instruments.","t":"她**拥有**很高的音乐天赋，会演奏四种乐器。"},
47572:{"w":"instruct","e":"PE teachers instruct students how to exercise, play sports, and do other recreational activities correctly and safely.","t":"体育老师**指导**学生们如何安全正确地锻炼、做运动以及进行其他娱乐活动。"},
