47577:{"w":"bill","e":"After dinner, my father asked the waiter to bring the bill.","t":"晚饭后，爸爸请服务员把**账单**拿来。"},
47578:{"w":"muddy","e":"The path was so muddy after the rain that we had to wear boots.","t":"雨后小路**泥泞**不堪，我们只好穿上靴子。"},
47579:{"w":"soon","e":"Please be patient, because the doctor will see you soon.","t":"请耐心等待，医生**很快**就会来看你。"},
