47582:{"w":"pack","e":"I need to pack my suitcase tonight, because we leave early tomorrow.","t":"我今晚得**整理**行李箱，因为明天要早走。"},
47583:{"w":"shuttle","e":"A free shuttle runs between the airport and the hotel every half hour.","t":"每半小时有一班免费的**往返班车**行驶于机场和酒店之间。"},
