47585:{"w":"porter","e":"A porter at the station helped the old man carry his heavy bags to the train.","t":"车站的一名**搬运工**帮老人把沉重的包搬上了火车。"},
47586:{"w":"spoon","e":"She stirred her tea slowly with a small spoon.","t":"她用一把小**勺**慢慢搅着茶。"},
