47590:{"w":"architect","e":"Among mathematicians and architects, left-handers tend to be more common.","t":"在数学家和**建筑师**中，惯用左手者往往更为常见。"},
47591:{"w":"please","e":"Please close the door when you leave the room.","t":"离开房间时，**请**把门关上。"},
47592:{"w":"reserve","e":"We reserved the room a week ago.","t":"我们一星期前就**预订**了这个房间。"},
47593:{"w":"without","e":"He left the house without his umbrella.","t":"他出门**没**带伞。"},
47594:{"w":"abroad","e":"More and more Chinese students choose to study abroad after they finish high school.","t":"越来越多的中国学生高中毕业后选择**出国**留学。"},
47595:{"w":"track","e":"The road system here evolved from the goat tracks followed by the early inhabitants.","t":"这里的道路系统是在早期居民所走的羊肠**小道**的基础上发展起来的。"},
