47599:{"w":"glad","e":"I'm glad to see you again after such a long time.","t":"时隔这么久又见到你，我很**高兴**。"},
47600:{"w":"neighbourhood","e":"There are several good schools and a large park in our neighbourhood.","t":"我们家**附近**有好几所好学校和一个大公园。"},
47601:{"w":"enjoyable","e":"There is going to be a very enjoyable TV programme this evening.","t":"今天晚上将有一期非常**有意思**的电视节目。"},
47602:{"w":"symbol","e":"The sounds of boat whistles and the moving tides are symbols of a port city.","t":"汽笛声和海浪声是港口城市的**象征**。"},
