47607:{"w":"sorrow","e":"Carolyn's eyes filled with sorrow at thinking of how she had treated Kevin and lost him forever.","t":"想到自己那样对待凯文并永远地失去了他，卡罗琳的眼中充满了**悲伤**。"},
