47615:{"w":"guard","e":"Soldiers guard the gate day and night.","t":"士兵们日夜**看守**着大门。"},
47616:{"w":"urge","e":"The doctor urged him to stop smoking and to take more exercise.","t":"医生**催促**他戒烟，多做运动。"},
