47637:{"w":"candidate","e":"Each candidate gave a short speech before the students voted.","t":"投票前，每位**候选人**都做了简短的演讲。"},
47638:{"w":"burden","e":"Looking after three young children alone is a heavy burden for the young mother.","t":"独自照顾三个孩子，对这位年轻妈妈来说是个**重担**。"},
