47640:{"w":"arm","e":"He broke his arm when he fell off the bike.","t":"他从自行车上摔下来，摔断了**手臂**。"},
47641:{"w":"royal","e":"Thousands of people came to watch the royal wedding in front of the palace.","t":"数千人来到王宫前观看**王室**婚礼。"},
