47643:{"w":"astronomer","e":"The astronomer used a large telescope to study distant stars.","t":"这位**天文学家**用大望远镜研究遥远的恒星。"},
47644:{"w":"print","e":"Please print this report and bring it to the meeting.","t":"请把这份报告**打印**出来，带到会上。"},
47645:{"w":"natural","e":"It's natural for an old man of his age to be so calm.","t":"处于他这般年纪的老人如此镇静是很**自然**的。"},
